{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/25/8594732/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は珍しく！\n斎藤家の愛犬\"さくら\"( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて凛々しい顔...\n女の子なのに凛々しすぎる...\nそして目がキラキラしている..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎる...♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤家の自慢の家族です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/25/8594732/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の雪が、天気が\n嘘だったんじゃないかと思えるくらいに\n綺麗な空。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空が青く、雲も少なめなので\n紅葉がよく目立ちます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅葉って綺麗だな〜\n落ちてしまう葉って風情がある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は楽天showtimeさんにて\n乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部放送の日！\n(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/25/8594732/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と少しおふざけ。\n2人ともえっ！？という顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/25/8594732/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈とまあやと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カートの中では、私達3人が後ろで\n前に伊織とマネージャーさんというのが\n定位置になっていました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん是非見てね〜\nゲーム形式の新しい回でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/25/8594732/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装はタートルネック。\n寒い時にはタートルネックが一番な気がする♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タートルネック×ポニーテール好き◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Mr.Snowman」E-girlsさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雰囲気も歌詞の中の女の子も\nとっても可愛い。\n寒いけどそんなものには負けないという、\n女の子パワー全開で\n聞いていてとっても楽しい。\nキラキラ輝いていて\n冬が楽しみになる曲。\n\"手を取って 駆け出して\n冬の空飛んでいきたいの\nCandy Cotton Candy\n恋はねえ 雪より甘いのよ？\"\n雪より甘い恋。\nなんて可愛い表現なんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のコメントに\n沢山のお祝いメッセージがヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことがあった時に\n一緒に喜んでくれる方がいることに\n幸せを感じます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとこれからも\n喜びを沢山共有できるようになりたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}